ss="codex-grid">${DNA_CODEX.map((entry,i)=>`<article class="card codex-entry"><div class="codex-entry-top"><span class="codex-index">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="tag">${entry.category}</span></div><h2>${entry.title}</h2><p>${entry.text}</p></article>`).join('')}</div><section class="card codex-citation"><strong>Reading critically</strong><p>These notes provide a starting point, not medical or laboratory advice. For current details, consult peer-reviewed reviews, curated databases, and organism-specific sources; distinguish observed evidence from hypotheses and simulations.</p></section>`}
